    "PRD, detailed interaction/content specifications, prototype and screenshots form a joint product-design deliverable; each rule retains one governing location.",
    "All nineteen requirements and eighteen acceptance IDs have exactly one primary package; permission, service failure, versions and AI responsibility also apply across packages.",
